<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">Gracias a la vida</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">composed <a href="/years/1966">1966</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">&quot;Gracias a la vida&quot; was written, composed and first performed by the Chilean folk singer-songwriter Violeta Parra, one of the artists of the movement and musical genre known as the Nueva Canción Chilena. She composed it in La Paz, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/bolivia">Bolivia</a>, in 1966, and it was included on Las Últimas Composiciones, the last album she released before her death by suicide in 1967.</p></div>
